# Build context allowlist: the image needs only the pinned requirements, the
# package metadata, the application source, the reference configs and the
# health probe. Everything else (VCS data, local secrets, caches, tests,
# frontend sources) stays out of the context and therefore out of the image.
*

!requirements.txt
!pyproject.toml
!setup.py
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/lg_sotf/
!configs/
!docker/healthcheck.py

# Never ship bytecode, build metadata or local environment files.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.env
**/.env.*
